을 먹 [ ? ] 싶어요.", "options": ["어요", "고"], "answer": "고", "feedback": {"correct": "Correct! 먹 + 고 싶어요"}}, {"type": "fill_blank", "instruction": "I want to drink water.", "sentence": "저는 물을 [ ? ] 싶어요.", "options": ["마시고", "마셔요"], "answer": "마시고", "feedback": {"correct": "Right! 마시 + 고 싶어요"}}, {"type": "fill_blank", "instruction": "I want to go to the library.", "sentence": "저는 도서관에 [ ? ] 싶어요.", "options": ["가요", "가고"], "answer": "가고", "feedback": {"correct": "Great! 가 + 고 싶어요"}}, {"type": "fill_blank", "instruction": "I want to read a book.", "sentence": "저는 책을 [ ? ] 싶어요.", "options": ["읽고", "읽어요"], "answer": "읽고", "feedback": {"correct": "Perfect! 읽 + 고 싶어요"}}, {"type": "fill_blank", "instruction": "I want to go to a café.", "sentence": "저는 카페에 [ ? ] 싶어요.", "options": ["가고", "가요"], "answer": "가고", "feedback": {"correct": "Correct! 가 + 고 싶어요"}}]}}, {"step_type": "practice", "title": "Round 2: Say it whole", "instruction": "Pick the whole phrase. Watch where 안 goes.", "content": {"exercises": [{"type": "fill_blank", "instruction": "Do you want to go to school?", "sentence": "학교에 [ ? ]?", "options": ["가요 싶어요", "가고 싶어요"], "answer": "가고 싶어요", "feedback": {"correct": "Correct! 가 + 고 싶어요"}}, {"type": "fill_blank", "instruction": "I don't want to eat bread.", "sentence": "저는 빵을 [ ? ].", "options": ["안 먹고 싶어요", "먹고 안 싶어요"], "answer": "안 먹고 싶어요", "feedback": {"correct": "Right! 안 goes right before the verb."}}, {"type": "fill_blank", "instruction": "I want to drink coffee.", "sentence": "저는 커피를 [ ? ].", "options": ["마셔요 싶어요", "마시고 싶어요"], "answer": "마시고 싶어요", "feedback": {"correct": "Great! 마시 + 고 싶어요"}}, {"type": "fill_blank", "instruction": "Do you want to read a book?", "sentence": "책을 [ ? ]?", "options": ["읽고 싶어요", "읽어요 싶어요"], "answer": "읽고 싶어요", "feedback": {"correct": "Perfect! 읽 + 고 싶어요"}}, {"type": "fill_blank", "instruction": "I want to eat at a restaurant.", "sentence": "저는 식당에서 밥을 [ ? ].", "options": ["먹고 싶어요", "먹어요 싶어요"], "answer": "먹고 싶어요", "feedback": {"correct": "Correct! 먹 + 고 싶어요"}}, {"type": "fill_blank", "instruction": "I don't want to drink water.", "sentence": "저는 물을 [ ? ].", "options": ["마시고 안 싶어요", "안 마시고 싶어요"], "answer": "안 마시고 싶어요", "feedback": {"correct": "Right! 안 goes right before the verb."}}]}}, {"stepType": "agglutinative_quiz", "title": "Sentence Building #1", "instruction": "Build the sentence: \"I want to drink coffee.\" Split 고. 싶어요 stays whole. Use 마시, not 마셔.", "contentObj": {"sentence": "저는 커피를 마시고 싶어요.", "translation": "I want to drink coffee.", "elements": [{"id": "e1", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["저는"], "correct_turtle": ["저는"], "turtle_explanation": "Keep '저는' as one block — it is not this lesson's focus."}, {"id": "e2", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["커피를"], "correct_turtle": ["커피를"], "turtle_explanation": "Keep '커피를' as one block — it is not this lesson's focus."}, {"id": "e3", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["마시고"], "correct_turtle": ["마시", "고"], "turtle_explanation": "'고' links the verb to 싶어요. The verb stays the same."}, {"id": "e4", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["싶어요"], "correct_turtle": ["싶어요"], "turtle_explanation": "Keep '싶어요' as one block — it is not this lesson's focus."}], "options": [{"id": "o1", "text": "싶어요", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o2", "text": "커피를", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o3", "text": "커피를", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o4", "text": "싶어요", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o5", "text": "고", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o6", "text": "저는", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o7", "text": "어요", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o8", "text": "마시", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o9", "text": "마셔요", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o10", "text": "저는", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o11", "text": "마시고", "mode": "rabbit"}]}}, {"stepType": "agglutinative_quiz", "title": "Sentence Building #2", "instruction": "Build the sentence: \"I want to go to school.\" Split 고. 싶어요 stays whole.", "contentObj": {"sentence": "저는 학교에 가고 싶어요.", "translation": "I want to go to school.", "elements": [{"id": "e1", "